The components in this folder are an in-app replacement for Autodesk HIG
(https://github.com/Autodesk/hig), modelled on its markup and look.

Parts are derived from HIG, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

- icons.js: SVG paths from @hig/icons 4.1.0
- fonts.css: @font-face rules from @hig/fonts 1.1.0
- tokens.css and the component .css files: colour, size and spacing values from
  @hig/theme-data 2.23.0 (lightGrayMediumDensityTheme) and the HIG component styles
- avatar.js: the avatar colour palette and the name-to-colour/initials rules from @hig/avatar 2.1.0

